:null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5805451844","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110101#issuecomment-5805451844","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110101","id":5805451844,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWggqRA","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T00:50:04Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T00:50:04Z","body":"I don't think we want to shutdown the .NET build server or disable it. Its purpose is to speedup subsequent compilations by avoiding the startup and initialization cost. In fact, .NET 11 is leaning even more into this.\n\nTo export a Godot C# project, we execute a `dotnet publish` command. If this command is spawning a child process to launch the build server, I wonder if there's something we can do to avoid making that process a child of the Godot process. But since this process is launched by the dotnet CLI, it's likely that they're the ones that have to make that change.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5805451844/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]